    "preamble": "Jagatmitra Foundation vs Union Of India Through Its Secretary At ... on 12 September, 2024 Author: Tushar Rao Gedela Bench: Tushar Rao Gedela $~185 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(Crl) 2840/2024 Jagatmitra Foundation Through: Dr. Gaurav A petitioner O video confer Union Of India Through Its Secretary At Ministry Health And Family Welfare & Ors. Through: Mr. Apoorv Gurjas Sing respondent Coram: Hon'Ble The Acting Chief Justice Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Tushar Rao Ged % 12.09.2024 1.",
    "facts": "Present writ petition has been filed primarily seeking initiation of criminal proceedings against respondents No. 3 to 7 under the provisions of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (FSSAI Act) and Sections 272, 273 and 318 of Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita for their alleged violation of Food Safety and Standards (Advertising and Claims) Regulations, 2018 and Food Safety and Standards (Labelling and Display) Regulations, 2020.",
